## 1. Purpose

This software and associated documentation (the "Software") are provided solely for:

* educational use
* academic research
* personal learning
* non-commercial experimentation

The Software is intended to support the study of:

* navigation systems
* inertial sensing
* SO(3) rotations
* quaternions
* gyrocompassing
* sensor modeling
* engineering visualization

